---
/**
 * Hero section - logo, title, subtitle, intro text
 */
---

<section id="domov" class="hero section" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero__content">
    <img
      src="/images/image03.jpg"
      alt="Logo Putovneho kruhu - ohen a kruh"
      class="hero__logo"
      width="96"
      height="96"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <h1 id="hero-title">Putovny kruh</h1>
    <hr class="divider" />
    <p class="hero__subtitle">Muzsky kruh &ndash; okres Blansko</p>
    <p class="hero__intro">
      Toto je priestor pre muzov, ktori hladaju viac nez len povrchne debaty.
      Priestor, kde mozeme odlozit svoje masky, hovorit pravdu a nacuvat bez
      sudenia. Stretavame sa pri ohni, aby sme nasli spojenie sami so sebou a s
      ostatnymi chlapmi na svojej ceste.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 80vh;
    padding-top: calc(3.5rem + var(--space-3xl));
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .hero__logo {
    width: 6rem;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .hero .divider {
    margin-block: var(--space-md);
  }

  .hero__subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .hero__intro {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
